#: ../../maths/rates.md:1 54610c074c8442e3bcfca813677767de
msgid "Curves, swaps and cash flows"
msgstr "曲線、利率交換與現金流"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:3 ee4e26488f99401a9a20a3374782e2db
msgid "Discount factors are the primitive"
msgstr "折現因子是最基本的東西"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:5 696beca9ef6e402b9b63fcd37bd814a2
msgid "Everything on the rates side reduces to one function: the discount factor $P(0,t)$, the present value of one unit paid at $t$. Rates are ways of quoting it, and they only mean anything alongside a **compounding convention** and a **day count**."
msgstr "利率這一側的一切，都可以化約成一個函數：折現因子 $P(0,t)$，也就是在 $t$ 支付一單位的現值。利率是報出它的各種方式，而它們唯有搭配**複利慣例**與**日計方式**才有意義。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md b40be1a48a8c4483b190e2d5ff46a431
msgid "Convention"
msgstr "慣例"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 78db385db6fe47e5a7c2653775c32367
msgid "Relation"
msgstr "關係式"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 18fb3dfa062341788d1ff5b5c3081f47
msgid "continuous"
msgstr "連續複利"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 213e00cee4bf478dab4f02213c14bb04
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$P = e^{-z t}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md 0474b41371a5480eb6559a477cbd0099
msgid "simple"
msgstr "單利"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 0c86e068649e4e16b502eab112d92356
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$P = \\dfrac{1}{1 + z\\,\\tau}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md 6d40fcc9575b412fb7032541b7ba1a6a
msgid "compounded, frequency $f$"
msgstr "以頻率 $f$ 複利"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 519184965dcf453c9813df574da10d34
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$P = \\left(1 + \\dfrac{z}{f}\\right)^{-f t}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:16 3c348fab18254d968b42e3d9a459fc91
msgid "$\\tau$ is the accrual factor from the day counter, which is *not* $t$ in general — Actual/360 and Actual/365 disagree by 1.4%, and 30/360 disagrees with both. This is why the curve-sampling panel makes you name the compounding, the frequency and the day counter before it will draw a zero-rate curve, and why it refuses a compounding set beside a discount-factor request: a discount factor has no convention, and accepting one would imply it did."
msgstr "$\\tau$ 是日計方式算出的計息因子，一般而言*不等於* $t$——Actual/360 與 Actual/365 相差 1.4%，而 30/360 與兩者都不同。這正是曲線取樣面板在畫零息利率曲線之前，要你指明複利方式、頻率與日計方式的原因；也是它拒絕在折現因子請求旁邊設定複利方式的原因：折現因子沒有慣例，收下一個慣例會暗示它有。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:23 ea0957dbeef44a9ba18c587ab7b425c5
msgid "The forward rate between $t_1$ and $t_2$ follows:"
msgstr "$t_1$ 與 $t_2$ 之間的遠期利率隨之而來："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:25 355a15864c924109b49859e0e28dff55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"f(t_1,t_2) = \\frac{1}{\\tau}\\left(\\frac{P(0,t_1)}{P(0,t_2)} - 1\\right)\n"
"\\quad\\text{(simple)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"f = \\frac{\\ln P(0,t_1) - \\ln P(0,t_2)}{t_2 - t_1}\n"
"\\quad\\text{(continuous)}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:31 77e16748f454495d84b0912adab220cb
msgid "The four curve shapes"
msgstr "四種曲線形狀"

#: ../../maths/rates.md f071f394f8db4c81aaf4ac4a0ac11f42
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形狀"

#: ../../maths/rates.md d45e8cd34428436b9e096a19643d06dc
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "是什麼"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 04d59a6a134c4743a4daed01265987da
msgid "Live quotes?"
msgstr "可用即時報價？"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 667c2ea178a145fdb89862b84af9dd51
msgid "flat"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md 1c1db278fc8442c79966c579919dae78
msgid "One rate for all maturities"
msgstr "所有到期日共用一個利率"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 18bdac46fd024f928a25e496e6d1c050
#: 5300217791974008bcbf37d8ffe692f1
msgid "yes"
msgstr "可以"

#: ../../maths/rates.md be5712f0df7f401985a1b964972d5cec
msgid "zero"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md b1c679cbb1e34184a180e2f50bbcbbd5
msgid "Interpolated zero rates through fixed nodes (linear)"
msgstr "以固定節點內插零息利率（線性）"

#: ../../maths/rates.md 741280995f0345d388ca82a6e262ec3e
#: 7f2c1e5a20b2448a92583ae2dee081c3
msgid "no"
msgstr "不行"

#: ../../maths/rates.md a0251635b244404394180ade6f5da800
msgid "discount"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md 54746e98eb8d4408b1279edbb45348c2
msgid "Interpolated discount factors through fixed nodes (log-linear)"
msgstr "以固定節點內插折現因子（對數線性）"

#: ../../maths/rates.md addd28a894084fbbb45eb41f5e762d11
msgid "bootstrap"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md 98270fe5d86649f8b2ffed7027103723
msgid "Stripped from market instruments"
msgstr "由市場工具剝離而得"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:40 ae447373e1404fce851d366c4d94a26d
msgid "Log-linear interpolation on discount factors is linear interpolation on $\\ln P$, which means **piecewise-constant continuous forwards** — the usual default, and the reason a discount curve drawn as forwards looks like a staircase."
msgstr "對折現因子做對數線性內插，等於對 $\\ln P$ 做線性內插，也就代表**分段常數的連續遠期利率**——這是常見的預設，也是折現曲線畫成遠期利率時看起來像階梯的原因。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:45 f05612ce9a1047ceb09e78ead0c4afbf
msgid "Bootstrapping"
msgstr "拔靴建構"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:47 53609124e7854a62b229ab2b2f47197d
msgid "A bootstrapped curve is built so that it reprices, exactly, the instruments it was built from. Each pillar adds one unknown and one equation, solved in maturity order — hence *bootstrap*."
msgstr "拔靴建構出來的曲線，會精確地重新算回建構它所用的那些工具的價格。每一個支點加入一個未知數與一條方程式，依到期順序逐一求解——*拔靴*之名由此而來。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:51 2a6961303fa445b4a35f1d1cbba4879d
msgid "**Deposit.** A simple-rate quote over one accrual period:"
msgstr "**存款**。單一計息期間上的單利報價："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:53 8599f6765b32424390256c904779cb2f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "P(0,t) = \\frac{1}{1 + r\\,\\tau}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:55 8df26c65fced4471985eb2a74675ae27
msgid "**Par swap.** The fixed rate that makes the swap worth zero. With payment times $t_1 \\dots t_n$ and accruals $\\tau_i$,"
msgstr "**平價交換**。使該筆交換價值為零的固定利率。以付款時點 $t_1 \\dots t_n$ 與計息因子 $\\tau_i$ 表示，"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:58 afea2a83a1f747208e1561eee18c3f5e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "K \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\tau_i P(0,t_i) \\;=\\; P(0,t_0) - P(0,t_n),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:60 7771b25f5e38497f82b9f73362c0c178
msgid "the right-hand side being the value of the floating leg when its forwards come off the same curve. The sum on the left is the **annuity**."
msgstr "右邊是浮動腳的價值——當它的遠期利率取自同一條曲線時。左邊的加總就是**年金因子**。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:63 fc0c1c4f17f24d2587807f44685fca25
msgid "**OIS.** The same equation with the floating leg compounded daily off the overnight index rather than accrued over each period."
msgstr "**OIS**。同一條方程式，只是浮動腳改成依隔夜指標逐日複利，而不是逐期計息。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:66 28a671b5dcb64dd48e452ae49394c58d
msgid "The type of curve being solved for is a choice of *traits* — what is interpolated — and *interpolator*. This build compiles three of each (discount, zero yield, forward rate × linear, log-linear, cubic). The choice is not cosmetic: interpolating zero rates linearly and interpolating discount factors log-linearly give different forwards between pillars, and both reprice the pillars exactly. If two curves disagree away from the pillars, that is the interpolation, not an error."
msgstr "要解出來的曲線型別，是 *traits*（內插的對象）與 *interpolator*（內插法）的選擇。這個版本各編譯了三種（折現、零息利率、遠期利率 × 線性、對數線性、三次樣條）。這個選擇不是外觀問題：對零息利率做線性內插與對折現因子做對數線性內插，在支點之間會給出不同的遠期利率，而兩者都精確重算回支點。若兩條曲線在支點以外不一致，那是內插造成的，不是錯誤。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:75 0eed2acc116545df967483039962a0fc
msgid "The clean test that a bootstrap worked is that a par instrument reprices to zero. The worked swap example does exactly that: a five-year swap on the 5Y pillar prices to an NPV of $-0.000002$ with a fair rate of $0.027000$."
msgstr "驗證拔靴建構成功最乾淨的檢查，是平價工具重新計價後等於零。現成的交換範例正是如此：一筆掛在 5Y 支點上的五年期交換，計價後淨現值為 $-0.000002$，公平利率為 $0.027000$。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:80 13f3e9794696411fb5dac9d1fe666b2f
msgid "Swap pricing"
msgstr "利率交換的計價"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:82 2badb145708647ea9301af4c3ec374c7
msgid "A swap is a set of legs, each a set of cash flows, each discounted:"
msgstr "一筆交換是一組計息腳，每腳是一組現金流，每一筆都折現："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:84 5209131949bc4fa09aa3c59b2e873d9c
msgid "\\text{NPV} = \\sum_{\\text{legs}} \\pm \\sum_{c \\in \\text{leg}} c\\;P(0,t_c),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:86 18d39face53e46e4b769d0c65c2db5cf
msgid "with the sign given by pay-or-receive on each leg. A fixed coupon is $N\\,\\tau_i\\,K$; a floating coupon is $N\\,\\tau_i\\,(g\\,f_i + s)$ for gearing $g$ and spread $s$, where $f_i$ is the index fixing — read from the fixing history if the fixing date has passed, and **forecast off the index's forwarding curve** otherwise."
msgstr "正負號由每腳的付或收決定。固定票息為 $N\\,\\tau_i\\,K$；浮動票息為 $N\\,\\tau_i\\,(g\\,f_i + s)$，其中 $g$ 為槓桿倍數、$s$ 為利差，而 $f_i$ 是指標定盤值——若定盤日已過就從歷史定盤讀取，否則就**由該指標的預測曲線推算**。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:92 ac527311b9f346d2a764486045970094
msgid "Leg BPS and the fair rate"
msgstr "各腳 BPS 與公平利率"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:94 813032ee12c14c17ac8b560bd40716ac
msgid "The BPS of a leg is what it is worth if its rate moves by one basis point:"
msgstr "一腳的 BPS，是它的利率變動一個基點時的價值："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:96 2e1f2190ee1f4f5f9efc6849115ee5fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{BPS} = \\pm\\, 10^{-4} \\sum_i N\\,\\tau_i\\,P(0,t_i)\n"
"= 10^{-4} \\times \\text{annuity}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:99 68bafc9522f347e8978310f5566c805f
msgid "The fair rate follows directly, and this is exactly what the service computes for a two-leg swap (fixed first, floating second):"
msgstr "公平利率隨之而來，而這正是服務為兩腳交換（固定腳在前、浮動腳在後）所計算的東西："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:102 6e4c28ed29f94fbcba5220d702645da2
msgid ""
"K^{\\ast} = -\\frac{\\text{NPV}_{\\text{float}}}{\\text{annuity}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\text{annuity} = \\frac{\\text{BPS}_{\\text{fixed}}}{10^{-4}}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:106 56dc784400374de2bfe1f411adb35400
msgid "The leg order matters because the formula does not check which leg is which — which is why the service refuses the request rather than computing it off the wrong leg."
msgstr "腳的順序有影響，因為公式並不檢查哪一腳是哪一腳——這也是服務寧可拒絕該請求，也不肯拿錯的那一腳算出結果的原因。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:110 012a28ff04fd4779a02260995e587eef
msgid "The cash flow table"
msgstr "現金流表"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:112 65fc5959108d482dbd3919475ae9aeed
msgid "Each row carries its payment date, the amount, the discount factor the engine used, and their product. The property that makes the table worth showing is"
msgstr "每一列帶著付款日、金額、引擎所用的折現因子，以及三者相乘的結果。讓這張表值得展示的，是這個性質："

#: ../../maths/rates.md:115 166925c6195545f6b43cc250858438d7
msgid "\\sum_{\\text{rows}} \\text{present value} = \\text{NPV},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/rates.md:117 6ee258b9af10459ea2044eb6a9ee6904
msgid "and the service's own test asserts it. Coupons add their accrual dates, notional and rate; floating coupons add the fixing date, spread and gearing, and say whether the fixing was **historical or forecast** — which is the field to check first when a swap mid-period prices unexpectedly."
msgstr "而服務自己的測試會斷言它。票息會補上計息起訖日、名目本金與利率；浮動票息再補上定盤日、利差與槓桿倍數，並說明該定盤值是**歷史值或預測值**——當一筆跨期的交換算出意料之外的價格時，這是第一個該看的欄位。"

#: ../../maths/rates.md:122 4d9ee2562dc14b57a7da2c8f40d52db1
msgid "Rows already paid are left out."
msgstr "已支付的列不列出。"

